  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Top Up. Improving Cameroon`s migration management capacity and cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This projet aims to strengthen migration governance in Cameroon through the development of a comprehensive national migration policy, while enhancing institutional capacities for the safe, dignified, and effective return, readmission, and sustainable reintegration (RRR) of migrants and ensuring long-term socioeconomic integration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Objectifs:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. &lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective: Support to National Authorities to Develop Cooperation with the EU and Build National Capacities for the Management of Return, Readmission, and Reintegration.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Specific Objective: Support Community-Based Activities Addressing Root Causes of Irregular Migration and Facilitating Reintegration.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective: Support the Formulation of the First National Migration Policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;By aligning national efforts with global and African Union frameworks, this project supports the development of a comprehensive migration policy and addresses critical return, readmission, and reintegration challenges, enhancing Cameroon&#xbf;s capacity to manage migration flows effectively and sustainably.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
